!! Your notebook stays in this file
Create a note with the + button. Confirm the note with the check mark, then choose ''save changes'' (the cloud/download button) to download the updated HTML file. Open that new file and check your notes before deleting an older copy. Closing the tab without downloading can lose changes; this edition has no account, server notebook or installed browser-storage plugin.

Downloads are not encrypted by default. Keep private copies protected. Import only trusted notes and plugins: a wiki can contain executable code. External images, services and plugin-library requests are blocked by this edition's browser policy; no remote sync service is configured.

